<package name="qdmr" project="openSUSE:Factory">
  <title>Graphical code-plug programming tool for DMR radios</title>
  <description>qDMR is a simple to use and feature-rich code-plug programming software
(CPS) for cheap DMR radios.

Currently supported devices are:
 * Radioddity/Baofeng RD-5R
 * TYT MD-UV390
 * Retevis RT3S
 * Open GD77 firmware (GD77, RD-5R &amp; DM-1801)
 * AnyTone AT-D878UV, AT-D868UVE
 * Radioddity GD77 (untested)

</description>
  <url>https://dm3mat.darc.de/qdmr/</url>
</package>
